OL,3,AFarmer who called 999 saw 'large group
OL,4,Aof hooded and masked men' near RAF
OL,5,AFairford, she tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FGloucestershire Police say they were
OL,8,Falerted at about 00:45 BST on Sunday.
OL,9,FFive men remain in custody - they were
OL,10,Farrested under the Explosives Act, and
OL,11,Fon suspicion of preparing a terrorist
OL,12,Fact
OL,14,FRAF Fairford, in the Cotswolds, is used
OL,15,Fby the US military. President Trump
OL,16,Fsays the US had the five men "under
OL,17,Fview for a long time, and we got them"
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
