OL,3,AEmbattled Serbian president resigns,
OL,4,Apaving way for early elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had already announced his intention
OL,7,Fto resign in June and is currently
OL,8,Fstanding to be his party's candidate
OL,9,Ffor prime minister in the upcoming
OL,10,Fparliamentary elections. VuDMiDG cannot
OL,11,Frun for a third presidential term under
OL,12,FSerbia's constitution.
OL,14,FThe populist leader's administration
OL,15,Fhas been dogged by anger over alleged
OL,16,Fcorner-cutting.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
